<title>NORWAY: Transocean Q1 pre-tax more than doubles.</title>
<headline>Transocean Q1 pre-tax more than doubles.</headline>
<text>
<p>OSLO, May 20 (Reuster) - Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				   (millions of dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating revenue		    219,616     vs     81,220</p>
<p>  Operating income			44,583     vs     13,951</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profit			  40,749     vs     18,163</p>
<p>  Net profit				27,709     vs     11,825</p>
<p>  Q1 EPS				    $0.54	vs	$0.42</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Houston-based offshore services company is Transocean Offshore Inc.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
